WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:02.130
Hi, I'm Gav.

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:02.963
I'm Dan.

00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:04.230
We're The Slow Mo Guys.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.630
Dan's very excited today.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.600
This is actually, you
wanted to do this one.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.430
You saw a video on the internet

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:11.440
of a guy spinning wire wool.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.040
Yeah, fireworks, sort of thing.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.680
Looks like a Catherine
wheel, except homemade.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:16.690
Except you're the wheel.

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:18.600
Yeah, exactly, we got some wire wool here,

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.760
very fine stuff, the zero,
zero, zero, zero grade.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:23.400
And, you sort of puff it out,

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.980
attach it to some wires, spin it around

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:26.430
while it is on fire, and because

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:28.130
of the air that's all rushing through it,

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:29.280
it sort of just goes...

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.730
Almost took my eye out
with that there, almost.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:35.870
I'm a bit worried about,

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:38.460
it's going to be showering
sparks in every direction.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.200
Really hot sparks as well.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.000
Let's dumper down the grass,

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.380
because, you know, the grass looks good.

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:47.170
So, you've got a fire marshal there, yeah?

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:48.920
Alright good.
What was that?

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:50.640
Sorry I can't hear you
cause you're not real.

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:51.640
Shut up.

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:54.790
So we usually don't film
this late in the day.

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:58.210
The sun is almost completely,
you know, off the ground.

00:00:58.210 --> 00:00:59.530
But we want the darkness for this one,

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:03.193
cause we want the fire
to be the only light.

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:09.660
So as soon as it goes.

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:10.493
It's going now.

00:01:10.493 --> 00:01:11.920
Just go mental with it, yeah.

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:14.203
Wow!

00:01:20.746 --> 00:01:21.723
Flippen heck.

00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:25.293
Okay hold on, hold it
still, okay go for it.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:55.387
Well Dan, I think that was
a majestic looking video.

00:02:55.387 --> 00:02:56.490
Ah, it's so pretty.

00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:57.910
We experimented with a
lot of different stuff,

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:00.380
like wide open shutter, lower flame rates

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:02.550
actually as well, just
to get the light on you.

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:04.070
I thought it looked tremendous,

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:05.960
it was like a little music video going on.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:06.793
I burned you.

00:03:06.793 --> 00:03:08.050
Yeah, at one point you splashed

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:10.270
me with about 500 sparks in the face.

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:11.430
We did enjoy that.
And neck.

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:12.530
No, it was good fun.

00:03:17.602 --> 00:03:18.435
Ah, hot.

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:25.620
My favorite part of the video in fact.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:26.930
So this is about to go out.

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:29.870
So, do feel free to follow us on Twitter,

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:33.750
buy a shirt and subscribe
to The Slow Mo Guys.

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:35.860
It's almost like what's the
stuff in Mindcraft called

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:36.890
that lights up?

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:37.723
Glow stone?

00:03:37.723 --> 00:03:39.930
Glow stone, yes it's
almost like that, isn't it?

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:40.763
Glow stone.

00:03:40.763 --> 00:03:42.160
Glow stone.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:43.650
Cool, see you next time.

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:44.483
Goodnight.

00:03:44.483 --> 00:03:45.400
Do a little whirl.

00:03:48.641 --> 00:03:49.596
Oh god!

00:03:49.596 --> 00:03:50.679
It's burning.

00:03:51.599 --> 00:03:52.432
What did we expect?

00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:53.682
I don't know.

